stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> detected
  detected --> diagnosed
  detected --> mitigating: edge already acted
  diagnosed --> mitigating: authorized automatically
  diagnosed --> awaiting_approval: high impact or confidence below 0.8
  diagnosed --> escalated: no playbook
  awaiting_approval --> mitigating: named operator approves
  awaiting_approval --> rejected: operator rejects
  mitigating --> verifying: after 30 s
  mitigating --> escalated
  verifying --> recovered: verifier passes at 300 s
  verifying --> escalated: fault persists
  escalated --> awaiting_approval
  escalated --> mitigating
  escalated --> recovered: maintenance recorded
  recovered --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
